      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `749e950debf12e558a5fdc74ca535b3c490038579619e2642dfaa9804a35a0a2--victims-of-crime-indigenous-status-selected-states-and-territories.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Recorded Crime — Victims (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2015\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 8 of 8\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | d5ba99cc2bbb541ab0c319bcc95225585992bba993ebabdfb8877b866d099a6b | missing |\n| \"Table 16\" | 26a2d5b7cdcef316419484041257f09346837c99181dd9efc9f0c8460fbc6695 | missing |\n| \"Table 17\" | fdcadc079f03ce75aa6e334143eeb781ef0ddf6d5e3a6d0d9fdbad0293be350d | missing |\n| \"Table 18\" | bed4dfbf9355af9d0373a06bd95dec8593189236d55c233eb17997fcf314df0a | missing |\n| \"Table 19\" | b53724b5cbdf6f57289783be573de0a4f5134f341344ad72038f7194f8e56352 | missing |\n| \"Table 20\" | 68e8cbc2c30ce7c1bb570c1c0a8b88ef85fe9a95cf805186f4614026fcd9c973 | missing |\n| \"Table 21\" | 08133908104e8965f133bafd142838d6e76b54b7952b40395e12537e3353da8a | missing |\n| \"Explanatory Notes\" | 6374f0457498de9356af5ada222a3ea3282958ac016aef44517fb01f4b83824d | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
